  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the diced red bell pepper and cook until it is tender.",
    "Add the sliced zucchini and cook until it is tender.",
    "Add the robata-grilled portobello mushrooms, coconut milk, salt, and pepper, and stir well.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 10 minutes.",
    "Stir in the shredded cheese until it is melted and well combined.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
